{"id":"R0007","e":{"E2":["T","PDF",2,"III.A Demo design","CIOFL on four devices: two Jetson TX2","Four Jetson nodes (3 training/inference, 1 aggregator) with UAV-captured images and VisDrone2021 prototype a multi-UAV swarm (p1 Abstract/Sec I), satisfying E2 via explicit swarm architecture."]}}
{"id":"R0023","e":{"E3":["F","PDF",6,"V.E Useful Case Studies","decentralised decision logic and cooperative job sharing","Uses local TinyML/TFLite Micro reflex models (p4 Sec IV.A/IV.D) plus MQTT/CRDT agent coordination (p3 Alg. 1); despite prose mention of neighbor-assisted reasoning (p5 Sec V.C), no DNN model, split, or inference routing is defined, and the drone swarm case study reports only formation (+12%) and energy (+28%), not collaborative DNN inference."],"E4":["F","PDF",4,"V.A Performance Summary","average normalised workload results for all architectures","Reports 50-run generic testbed benchmarks (20 RPi 4B, 10 Jetson Nano; Table II: 67 ms, 147 mJ, 2.8 KB/s, 94.1% accuracy, 2.9 s recovery) and drone swarm formation/energy gains (p6 Sec V.E), without specifying a DNN model, dataset, or collaborative inference method; evaluates a generic architecture rather than a proposed collaborative inference method."],"E5":["T","sources/raw/core_searches/ieee_xplore_high_recall_export_2026-11-26.csv",0,"Online Date, CSV row 24","16 Apr 2026","Codex-supplied independently verified IEEE Xplore Online Date (2026-04-16), separate from ACDSA 2026 event date (5-7 Feb 2026); within 2021-01-01 to 2026-11-26."]}}
{"id":"R0027","e":{"E3":["F","PDF",6,"V.E Useful Case Studies","decentralised decision logic and cooperative job sharing","Assessed independently from R0027 PDF: deploys local TFLite Micro TinyML reflex models (p4-5 Sec IV.A/IV.D) with MQTT/CRDT agent coordination (p4 Alg. 1); no DNN model, partitioning, or inference routing is specified (p6 Sec V.C mentions neighbor-assisted reasoning only in prose), and drone swarm results cover formation (+12%) and energy (+28%), not collaborative DNN inference."],"E4":["F","PDF",5,"V.A Performance Summary","average normalised workload results for all architectures","Assessed independently from R0027 PDF: reports 50-run generic testbed metrics (20 RPi 4B, 10 Jetson Nano; Table I: 67 ms, 147 mJ, 2.8 KB/s, 94.1% accuracy, 2.9 s recovery) and drone swarm formation (+12%) and energy (+28%) (p6 Sec V.E), without defining a DNN model, dataset, or collaborative inference method; evaluates a generic architecture rather than a proposed collaborative inference method."],"E5":["T","sources/raw/core_searches/ieee_xplore_high_recall_export_2026-11-26.csv",0,"Online Date, CSV row 28","8 Jun 2026","Codex-supplied independently verified IEEE Xplore Online Date (2026-06-08), separate from ICASS 2026 event date; within 2021-01-01 to 2026-11-26."]}}
